5
00:02:14,400 --> 00:02:15,400
I guess so.

6
00:02:16,360 --> 00:02:19,020
You shouldn't get so overheated. You'll
catch pneumonia.

7
00:02:19,980 --> 00:02:20,980
Ah.

8
00:02:21,960 --> 00:02:22,960
Strong as a bull.

9
00:02:24,780 --> 00:02:25,780
Yes.

10
00:02:31,790 --> 00:02:34,250
