116
00:09:53,900 --> 00:09:54,900
Sarah, come with me.

117
00:09:55,320 --> 00:09:58,000
Felicity, if you're too frightened to
even ask him to dinner, how are you

118
00:09:58,000 --> 00:09:59,000
