I never turned down a meal.

130
00:10:52,020 --> 00:10:53,020
Oh.

131
00:10:53,320 --> 00:10:54,320
God.

132
00:10:55,360 --> 00:10:56,360
Fine.

133
00:10:56,820 --> 00:10:57,820
Oh, wonderful.

134
00:10:58,260 --> 00:10:59,340
Six o 'clock, then.

135
00:11:00,280 --> 00:11:01,280
Six and a half.

136
