231
00:18:31,270 --> 00:18:32,270
Nate,

232
00:18:33,530 --> 00:18:39,890
hot bear.

233
00:18:40,230 --> 00:18:41,230
More wood still?

234
00:18:42,050 --> 00:18:43,050
No, no.

235
00:18:58,679 --> 00:18:59,619
That's all right.

236
00:18:59,620 --> 00:19:01,480
