244
00:19:44,300 --> 00:19:45,560
Mr. King, sir.

245
00:19:46,100 --> 00:19:47,100
Gus Pike.

246
00:19:47,660 --> 00:19:51,500
I want to know just what business it is
of yours to be here with Felicity

247
00:19:51,500 --> 00:19:52,560
